      "summary_md": "- Decoupled commit data management from UI layers, introducing dedicated handlers for analysis workflows.\n- Added branch awareness with `getCurrentBranch` and selection tracking via `selectedCommits` and `alreadyAnalyzedSelection`.\n- Introduced force analysis capability through `handleAnalyzeForce` for re-triggering commit evaluations.\n- Refactored `liveAnalysisEngine` (removed) and integrated Cockpit UI, facts aggregation, and drift detection in `liveAnalysis.ts`.\n- Updated core method signatures: `constructor`, `execGit`, `aggregateFacts`, `workspaceParts` to support new data flows.\n- Removed obsolete git status tracking, tree view logic (`getTreeItem`, `getCollapsibleState`), and related symbols (107 total).\n- Added client-side database for commit data persistence, decoupling from direct UI rendering.\n- Minor README update reflecting enhanced project overview with Cockpit and analysis features.\n- Broad refactoring across 34 files: 141 symbols added, 10 modified, emphasizing API stability and modularity.",
